29
00:00:58,608 --> 00:00:58,608
Row seven moved in June. Listen

30
00:00:58,608 --> 00:01:00,483
Row seven moved in June

31
00:01:06,178 --> 00:01:08,244
The cell, the words that filled it

32
00:01:08,244 --> 00:01:10,228
