33
00:01:10,228 --> 00:01:11,597
Below, the whole call

34
00:01:11,597 --> 00:01:14,081
with every tool call the agent made

35
00:01:15,866 --> 00:01:17,948
Some answers are not clear enough

36
00:01:17,948 --> 00:01:18,966
to write down

37
00:01:18,966 --> 00:01:21,341
I think so, is not a fact

38
00:01:21,341 --> 00:01:22,756
Those wait for a person

39
00:01:22,756 --> 00:01:24,171
with the clip attached

40
00:01:24,171 --> 00:01:26,079
until a person decides

41
00:01:26,079 --> 00:01:28,304
And here is what a prompt can't do

42
00:01:28,304 --> 00:01:29,395
The office said

43
00:01:29,395 --> 00:01:31,274
I think it is five thirty

44
00:01:31,274 --> 00:01:33,749
The model tried to write that address

45
00:01:33,749 --> 00:01:36,499
The gate refused and sent the reason back

46
00:01:36,499 --> 00:01:37,915
The agent asked again

47
00:01:37,915 --> 00:01:39,094
got another maybe

48
00:01:39,094 --> 00:01:40,510
so it stays unwritten

49
00:01:40,510 --> 00:01:42,233
and a human gets the call

50
00:01:43,407 --> 00:01:44,428
Now it calls you

51
00:01:44,428 --> 00:01:46,332
and you play the front desk

52
00:01:46,332 --> 00:01:49,207
This is a real call with the same agent

53
00:01:49,207 --> 00:01:50,877
The office changed suites

54
00:01:50,877 --> 00:01:52,697
and hedged on new patients

55
00:02:32,861 --> 00:02:34,936
A minute later the call ends

56
00:02:34,936 --> 00:02:36,906
Suite three became suite four

57
00:02:36,906 --> 00:02:38,087
the number stayed

58
00:02:38,087 --> 00:02:40,450
and new patients got a question mark

59
00:02:40,450 --> 00:02:42,262
because, I think she might be

60
00:02:42,262 --> 00:02:43,536
is not an answer

61
00:02:43,536 --> 00:02:45,716
You are now row forty-one

62
00:02:45,716 --> 00:02:47,123
Then the plan files this

63
00:02:47,123 --> 00:02:48,390
an attestation sheet

64
00:02:48,390 --> 00:02:49,445
every correction

65
00:02:49,445 --> 00:02:51,205
