69
00:02:59,783 --> 00:03:02,648
AssemblyAI's Voice Agent API runs both

70
00:03:02,648 --> 00:03:04,706
ends of every recorded call

71
00:03:04,706 --> 00:03:07,258
and the live one in your browser

72
00:03:07,258 --> 00:03:09,933
Each clear answer is one tool call

73
00:03:09,933 --> 00:03:11,958
A write gate in code decides what

74
00:03:11,958 --> 00:03:13,383
