79
00:03:22,787 --> 00:03:24,710
Across forty recorded calls

80
00:03:24,710 --> 00:03:26,312
forty of forty outcomes

81
00:03:26,312 --> 00:03:28,395
a hundred and fifty of a hundred

82
00:03:28,395 --> 00:03:30,077
